@startuml
actor User
participant "User Selection UI" as UI <<UI>>
participant ":UserEndpoints" as UserEndpoints <<Controller>>
participant ":SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler" as SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler <<Handler>>
participant ":ApplicationDbContext" as ApplicationDbContext <<DbContext>>
participant Database

note right of SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler
  Managed by MediatR
end note

note right of ApplicationDbContext
  Managed by IoC
end note

User -> UI : Enter email to search for user
activate UI
UI -> UserEndpoints : GET /api/User/SearchForSelection?email=...
activate UserEndpoints
UserEndpoints -> SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler : Handle(SearchUserForSelectionQuery)
deactivate UserEndpoints
activate SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler
SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler -> ApplicationDbContext : Query DomainUsers by Email
deactivate SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext -> Database : Query DomainUsers
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate Database
Database --> ApplicationDbContext : List<DomainUser>
deactivate Database
activate ApplicationDbContext
ApplicationDbContext --> SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler : List<DomainUser>
deactivate ApplicationDbContext
activate SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler
SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler -> SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler : Map to UserForSelectionDto
SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler -> UserEndpoints : List<UserForSelectionDto>
deactivate SearchUserForSelectionQueryHandler
activate UserEndpoints
UserEndpoints --> UI : 200 OK (ApiResponse<List<UserForSelectionDto>>)
deactivate UserEndpoints
UI -> User : Show user selection results
deactivate UI

@enduml